# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# Canonical host is parentpresents.com (apex, no www, no trailing slash).
# The singular parentpresent.com — if it is registered — should be pointed here
# too, via a Cloudflare redirect rule at the zone level rather than this file.
#
# Trailing slashes are NOT handled here on purpose: astro.config sets
# build.format: "file", so every route emits /foo.html and Cloudflare Pages
# 301s /foo/ -> /foo natively at the edge. Adding rules here would fight it.
#
# The Appendix A legacy URL map is generated into this file in Phase 5 from
# src/data/redirects.json. Do not hand-edit that section.

https://www.parentpresents.com/* https://parentpresents.com/:splat 301!
